<title>SWEDEN: Sweden's H&amp;M to propose 5:1 share split.</title>
<headline>Sweden's H&amp;M to propose 5:1 share split.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish retailer Hennes &amp; Mauritz said on Thursday it will propose a five for one share split.</p>
<p>The company has previosly said it is interested in lowering the value of shares, which are currently trading at 1,135 crowns. -- Simon Haydon, Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700-1004</p>
</text>
